From: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Subject: clk: qcom: gcc-sm6115: Set HW_CTRL_TRIGGER for video GDSC

Backport of the one-line provider change from the SM6115 video series:
https://www.spinics.net/lists/kernel/msg6190927.html
The Venus driver switches VCODEC0 between SW and HW control at runtime.
Stock also declares qcom,support-hw-trigger for this GDSC.

--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm6115.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm6115.c
@@ -3218,6 +3218,7 @@ static struct gdsc gcc_vcodec0_gdsc = {
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "gcc_vcodec0",
 	},
+	.flags = HW_CTRL_TRIGGER,
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 };
 
